<p>An image showing an Israeli soldier striking a statue of Jesus Christ in the southern Lebanese Christian village of Debl spread online over the weekend, drawing condemnation in Lebanon and abroad. Israeli authorities said they authenticated the image, opened an investigation, and were treating the act seriously; Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said the soldier&#x27;s conduct did not reflect Israel&#x27;s values and expressed regret to Christians in Lebanon and around the world. The episode has resonated far beyond a single act of vandalism because it happened in an area of south Lebanon where Israeli forces are operating and where homes, schools, and other infrastructure have also been damaged during the conflict. The backlash, including calls from the US ambassador for swift accountability, has sharpened attention on the treatment of religious symbols and civilians in the border war. Israel&#x27;s response also makes clear that the country&#x27;s top leadership is not publicly defending the act.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/i5UpoMqwxSeiiLgqWMnuwZL8q-qyUD_dTeNSGbwlu07LQuzg9yKCWqbmfvcKU_NQyZ72OT17K5DbQ9V7t57D11Lw4CTocKOKPfP2R1sXV1v-s4kcrAvU_fhb8sxcpvuLkmhdbfcc1XcW7doV7Iucwe3dWXKHhL2MBicF4WbNC9ph2BscJR8C5wKJOZ9_dIzoqj8Bs83IFTrhdtewYKnvNX4CkOfHNriq9XPWOZw' alt='An Israeli soldier damages the head of a statue of Jesus in Debel, Lebanon.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Village identified: Local officials said the sculpture stood in Debl, a Christian village near the Israel-Lebanon border, helping explain why the image struck such a sensitive religious and communal nerve.</li><li>Tool described: Reports said the soldier used either an axe or a sledgehammer against the crucifix statue; Al-Monitor said he aimed the blow at the head after the figure had fallen from the cross.</li><li>US pressure: The US ambassador to Israel publicly called for &quot;swift&quot; consequences, a notable response from a close Israeli ally rather than a traditional critic.</li><li>Domestic backlash: Al Jazeera reported that some of President Trump&#x27;s former MAGA allies also condemned the act as the desecration of a Christian symbol, widening the political fallout in the United States.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israeli military: The military said it views the soldier&#x27;s actions with &quot;great severity&quot; and is investigating the incident after verifying that the image was authentic. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cpd575n1znzo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Benjamin Netanyahu: Netanyahu apologized for the offense caused to Christians, said the soldier&#x27;s conduct does not represent Israel, and promised punitive steps. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/20/world/middleeast/israeli-soldier-lebanon-sledgehammer-jesus.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>US ambassador to Israel: The ambassador demanded quick consequences for the soldier, signaling concern from Washington about the image&#x27;s religious and diplomatic impact. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cpd575n1znzo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Critics in US conservative circles: Some former MAGA allies of President Trump denounced the act as the desecration of a Christian religious symbol. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/20/outcry-grows-over-israeli-soldier-smashing-jesus-statue-in-lebanon'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://english.elpais.com/international/2026-04-20/image-of-israeli-soldier-knocking-down-statue-of-jesus-in-lebanon-prompts-rare-apology-from-netanyahu.html'>Image of Israeli soldier knocking down statue of Jesus in Lebanon prompts rare apology from Netanyahu</a> - elpais.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/21/global-fallout-grows-over-israeli-soldier-smashing-jesus-statue-in-lebanon'>Global fallout grows over Israeli soldier smashing Jesus statue in Lebanon</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cpd575n1znzo'>Outrage over Israeli soldier&#x27;s vandalism of Jesus statue in Lebanon</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/20/world/middleeast/israeli-soldier-lebanon-sledgehammer-jesus.html'>Israeli Soldier in Lebanon Sledgehammered a Statue of Jesus</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/israel-pm-vows-harsh-action-against-soldier-vandalising-jesus-statue-lebanon'>Israel PM vows &#x27;harsh action&#x27; against soldier vandalising Jesus statue in Lebanon</a> - al-monitor.com</li></ul>